      "statement": "Integration tests boot workshop-backend and gatekeepers as real Workers in workerd via wrangler's createTestHarness with their checked-in wrangler.jsonc patched in memory, and speak Cap'n Web over a WebSocket to /api exactly like the browser — the code under test runs in another process and nothing but outbound HTTP is stubbed.",
