      "statement": "Cap'n Web stubs are only serializable by the instance owning their session, so a consumer repo with two pnpm stores can hit a two-copies failure only in CI; the toolkit owns the boundary by minting stubs exclusively through rpc-client's stubFor(), enforced by lint rules restricting capnweb value imports in the package.",
